 "title": {
  "zh": "例 1：Li I 2s ²S 和 2p ²P",
  "en": "Example 1: Li I 2s ²S and 2p ²P"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "入门示例。先做 2s 和 2p 的 Dirac-Hartree-Fock 计算，再分别加入到 n = 3 的单、双、三重激发做 MCDHF，接着做含 Breit 和 QED 修正的 CI、变换到 LSJ 耦合，计算超精细常数、同位素移位、2s–2p 的 E1 跃迁，最后生成能级表和跃迁表 (rtablevels、rtabtrans1/2)。",
  "en": "A first example. Dirac-Hartree-Fock for 2s and 2p, then MCDHF with single, double and triple excitations to n = 3 for each state, CI with Breit and QED corrections, transformation to LSJ coupling, hyperfine constants, isotope shifts, the 2s–2p E1 transition, and energy and transition tables (rtablevels, rtabtrans1/2)."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "几秒钟",
  "en": "a few seconds"
 },
